 Let me amplify that selpa'i was correct in picking up two points I missed.
 lo gercmo is a barker, not a bark.  The bark itself would be gerselcmo or
gercmosna.  And he is correct about needing a gi'e (or .i je bo) to break
up the ungrammatical double sentence.
                          --gejyspa


